    "description": "3 Gmail tricks that make your inbox way less stressful 👇\n\n1️⃣ Schedule send\nWriting late at night? Tap the 3-dot menu → Schedule send → pick a time. Your email lands at 8 AM, not at midnight.\n\n2️⃣ Swipe to archive\nSwipe any email in your inbox to archive it in one move. Want a different action? Go to Settings → Swipe actions and set it to delete, snooze, mark as read and more.\n\n3️⃣ Snooze an email\nOpen it, tap the 3-dot menu → Snooze → choose when. The email disappears now and comes back to the top of your inbox exactly when you need it.\n\n💬 Which trick are you trying first? Comment 1, 2 or 3!\n\n🔔 Subscribe for quick app tutorials every week.\n\n🌐 More tips and AI prompts: https://keepmesignedin.com\n\n#gmail #gmailtips #productivity #emailtips #inboxzero #shorts",
